			"summary": "The maintainer reframes the request as selective parallelism (annotating a recipe so its dependencies run concurrently) versus universal parallelism, and lists two forms of the latter: a `--parallel` CLI flag, which could break justfiles relying on dependency order, or a justfile setting. He leans toward universal parallelism and asks whether this matches what people want.",
